  "description": "Zelos Strategy choices, healing instructions, both ranged positions, active formation lanes and independent preset edits.",
  "registration": "Controlled Rust fixture sets formation 1/2/3/6/4/5/7/8 in both ordinary checkpoint copies; story 2500, member statistics, skit history and source input prefix stay unchanged. Zelos occupies active slot four so his selected battle lane is visible. Source-observed ambient origins are applied once at native update 64. First menu presentation pairs native 76 with source VI 12; later inputs and images use source VI + 64 with no stalls or phase adjustments. Gates compare Strategy focus/option/list position, all nine current instruction triples, all three complete presets, formation, field leader and effect random state. Together with strategy-reserves-pair this covers every character, including the alternate Kratos roster. Consecutive description captures cover a settled change and interrupted fades in current and preset options. Gates also compare the retained outgoing description and the post-draw fade counter. All timing comes from ordinary menu updates.",
